    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "Go over this for me again, Superintendent Ch'en."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Am I not being clear enough?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "No, you're clear as day. So perfectly clear that I thought I misheard."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "Superintendent Ch'en, you should know this is outside your purview."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Laws are different from one country to another, but common sense applies everywhere."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "What did the Royal Guard Academy teach you anyway? Did they ever tell you to keep your feet on the ground and not bite off more than you can chew?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I graduated long ago. Now, I'm a police officer serving Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I'll repeat again, so listen up. 'My wish is to join the L.G.D., and from there, I'll join the Special Inspection Unit.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I will protect this city, and I'll clean this place up. There won't be another incident like that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "What incident?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Well, aren't you forgetful? Or are you just playing dumb on purpose?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "Watch your mouth, Officer Ch'en."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "My apologies, Chief Wei."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Sir, I am referring to the incident that took place roughly ten years ago when the city was infiltrated by foreign forces. Several Lungmen citizens were kidnapped, and they are yet to be found."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I will continue to push the city to investigate and locate the kidnapped citizens after my admission to the department."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "Ch'en... You have no idea what you are talking about."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Sir, I am perfectly aware of what I am talking about."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "I won't argue. How about this, then? As soon as you don't think you can keep it up, just let me know."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu",
        "text": "Tell me, Superintendent Ch'en. How long do you want to be in the department?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
