    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't give him an answer."
    },
    {
        "text": "For all these years, I've always wondered... just how much longer can I do this? How much longer do I want to do this?"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it wasn't until now that I finally realized the answer isn't for me to decide."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Chi Xiao has gotten pretty rusty in my hand lately. I wonder just when will I finally understand? Shadowless doesn't mean to chase after shadows or let go. Instead, it's to never look back."
    },
    {
        "text": "'As\u00a0sword\u00a0ere\u00a0shadow's\u00a0trace,\u00a0cast\u00a0off\u00a0as\u00a0cast.'"
    },
